    "    /* Motion tokens (#1169) — the Soft Parlor motion table in DESIGN.md,",
    "       as numbers. Ease-out curves only; nothing here overshoots, because a",
    "       spring fights the warm posture. Every animation added for #1169 reads",
    "       its duration AND its delays from these, which is what lets the",
    "       reduced-motion block below and `.a11y` collapse all of them at once",
